Stack-Repair-Plan-v2: Seed each fixed batch from GetStrongRandBytes and expand coefficients using HMAC-SHA256 with distinct fixed domains and LE64 signature indices. Native signing adapters reuse this shared helper; clocks, addresses and counters are not entropy.
